# Secrets & sessions — NEVER commit these
.env
auth.json

# Downloaded CSV exports and debug artifacts
downloads/
debug/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.md
*.docx
*.csv

# ...but the runbooks in docs/ ARE the deployment instructions and must be in
# the repo. The blanket *.md above meant docs/deploying-the-daily-feed.md only
# ever existed on one laptop, which is exactly where a runbook is useless.
!docs/*.md
!README.md

